sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant APP as HomeWithPlugin
    participant CFG as TenantConfigService
    participant API as Backend API
    participant TPL as Active Template Resolver
    participant GAL as PhotoGallery
    participant CAP as PhotoCapture
    participant Q as UploadQueueService
    participant CL as Cloud Target

    U->>APP: App starten
    APP->>API: GET v1 access/deviceId
    APP->>CFG: load tenant config
    CFG->>API: GET v1 tenant-routing
    CFG->>API: GET v1 tenant-config/tenantId
    API-->>CFG: fields plus templates plus captureSteps
    CFG-->>APP: TenantConfig

    U->>APP: Standortdaten eingeben plus popType wählen
    APP->>TPL: resolve by popType
    TPL-->>APP: active templateId

    APP->>GAL: set variablesOrder from active captureSteps
    GAL-->>U: unterschiedliche Bildvariablen je popType

    U->>CAP: Foto aufnehmen
    CAP->>Q: Queue entry anlegen
    Q-->>APP: pending uploads

    U->>APP: Upload starten
    APP->>Q: upload entries for site
    Q->>CL: Datei hochladen
    CL-->>Q: Erfolg
    Q-->>APP: Status aktualisiert
